    "what_en": "Claude turns lookups into reproducible retrievals from 78 documented public database APIs, returning auditable results: databases used, endpoints, parameters, counts, and access dates, rather than relying on general knowledge.",
    "when_en": "When a scientific, regulatory, financial, or other database-backed fact must be retrieved reproducibly from a named source rather than inferred; i.e., for such factual questions.",
    "say_en": [
      {
        "text": "Look up the molecular weight of aspirin in PubChem.",
        "note": "It queries PubChem and returns a citable result."
      },
      {
        "text": "Find earthquakes of magnitude 5 or higher in California in 2023.",
        "note": "It queries USGS and returns matching records."
      },
      {
        "text": "What is the Ensembl ID and chromosomal location of TP53?",
        "note": "It verifies identifiers from Ensembl and other sources."
